{"id": "JRW-2023-0124-snow", "date": "2023-01-24", "operator": "JR西日本", "line": "琵琶湖線・JR京都線", "location": "山科〜島本。分岐器不転換は山科駅、京都駅、向日町駅", "cause_category": "natural_snow", "cause_summary": "大雪で山科駅、京都駅、向日町駅の分岐器が計21か所転換できなくなり、山科〜島本で15本が駅間に止まった。翌25日も京阪神の多くの線区で始発から運転を見合わせた。", "suspended_at": {"time": "2023-01-24T19:00+09:00", "approx": true}, "resumed_at": null, "duration_minutes": null, "first_stated_resume": null, "signals": [{"at": "2023-01-24T19:00+09:00", "approx": false, "signal": "向日町駅で分岐器が転換できなくなり、以後駅間停車が始まった", "source_url": "https://www.westjr.co.jp/press/article/items/230217_00_press_gohoukku.pdf"}, {"at": "2023-01-24T19:36+09:00", "approx": false, "signal": "山科駅でも分岐器が転換できなくなった", "source_url": "https://www.westjr.co.jp/press/article/items/230217_00_press_gohoukku.pdf"}, {"at": "2023-01-24T20:15+09:00", "approx": false, "signal": "京都駅でも分岐器が転換できなくなった", "source_url": "https://www.westjr.co.jp/press/article/items/230217_00_press_gohoukku.pdf"}, {"at": "2023-01-24T20:50+09:00", "approx": false, "signal": "最寄り駅への列車の収容を開始した", "source_url": "https://www.westjr.co.jp/press/article/items/230217_00_press_gohoukku.pdf"}, {"at": "2023-01-24T22:50+09:00", "approx": false, "signal": "対策本部が2本の列車で駅間降車を決めた", "source_url": "https://www.westjr.co.jp/press/article/items/230217_00_press_gohoukku.pdf"}, {"at": "2023-01-24T23:05+09:00", "approx": false, "signal": "普通列車1820Mで社員8名と消防隊40名による降車誘導を開始した", "source_url": "https://www.westjr.co.jp/press/article/items/230217_00_press_gohoukku.pdf"}, {"at": "2023-01-25T01:12+09:00", "approx": false, "signal": "駅間停車の解消が最も遅かった列車の収容が終わった", "source_url": "https://www.westjr.co.jp/press/article/items/230217_00_press_gohoukku.pdf"}, {"at": "2023-01-25T05:30+09:00", "approx": false, "signal": "1820Mの乗客全員の降車が完了した", "source_url": "https://www.westjr.co.jp/press/article/items/230217_00_press_gohoukku.pdf"}, {"at": null, "approx": false, "signal": "15本の駅間停車のうち13本を最寄り駅か京都駅へ収容し、最長5時間22分を要した。体調不良で16名が救急搬送された", "source_url": "https://www.westjr.co.jp/press/artic